wire.settings.web_search_searxng_endpoint.help	EN="Base URL of a self-hosted SearXNG instance."	UR="خود ہوسٹ کیے SearXNG سرور کا بیس URL۔"	OLD="Self-hosted SearXNG instance کا base URL۔"
